---
// Testimonials — user testimonials section
---
<section style="padding: 3rem 1.5rem; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem; font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1E293B; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Lo que dicen nuestros usuarios</h2>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2rem; align-items: stretch;">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; padding: 2rem; background: white; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(30,41,59,0.06);">
      <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; gap: 0.125rem;">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
      </div>
      <p style="flex: 1; font-style: italic; color: #334155; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.9375rem;">"Me dio una cifra muy realista para reformar mi piso en Indautxu. Luego pedí presupuestos a tres empresas del directorio y la diferencia fue mínima."</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1E293B; font-size: 0.875rem;">— Mikel R., Indautxu</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; padding: 2rem; background: white; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(30,41,59,0.06);">
      <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; gap: 0.125rem;">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
      </div>
      <p style="flex: 1; font-style: italic; color: #334155; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.9375rem;">"Para comparar presupuestos de cocina fue genial. Sabía qué precio era razonable antes de firmar con nadie."</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1E293B; font-size: 0.875rem;">— Ana L., Santutxu</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; padding: 2rem; background: white; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(30,41,59,0.06);">
      <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; gap: 0.125rem;">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b" width="18" height="18"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
      </div>
      <p style="flex: 1; font-style: italic; color: #334155; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.9375rem;">"Vivíamos en un piso del Casco Viejo y teníamos miedo del sobrecoste por la antigüedad. La calculadora nos dio el factor correcto."</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1E293B; font-size: 0.875rem;">— Pedro y Maribel, Casco Viejo</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    div[style*="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr)"] {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    }
  }
</style>
